ight).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\ln\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719" :question/answer-fields "6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e"] [:db/ensure "65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions "65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "1bb5b080-02ed-53d0-9c21-df4dc94dc39a"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/88/8855aab63f720970b468fc10b82c80953d8f46b63633982eeddd6537953843a6/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/validate]]
